ed-by on :payload while store/commit-record! reads :value, so the approver is not persisted at all (distinct from the architectural gap above, where it is persisted elsewhere).", :status :unfixed}}, :event/not-done ["phase-1 containment inversion in 31 repos — a governance defect, belongs in its own task not an item-2 wave" "cloud-itonami-isic-889 interrupt-before still not wired" "skill industry-stack-wave step 2 already-real test is too weak: it accepts a file that calls the real actor with fabricated inputs; needs an input-provenance check (subject ids present in the store seed, no rendered field absent from the domain model)" "docs/index.html does not link the console in most repos (only 4311 added it)" "no nightly regeneration gate (flagship item 4) — would be a murakumo fleet gate, not GitHub Actions" "isic-1394 approver identity dropped"], :event/superproject-adr "2608090800", :event/note "24/24 landed, 0 failed. Concurrency capped at 20 by the harness (CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONCURRENT_SUBAGENTS), so 4 repos were queued and launched as slots freed rather than run 24-wide. Every merge verified on main by fetching render_html.clj and operator-console.html sizes, not by trusting agent self-reports."}
